# DocsEverywhere (.NET)

Native bindings for docs_everywhere

The `DocsEverywhere` namespace binds the `docs_everywhere` native library through
source-generated P/Invoke (`[LibraryImport]`), so it's trim- and
AOT-friendly.

## Build

```bash
dotnet build
```

Reference this project from yours (`dotnet add reference DocsEverywhere.csproj`)
or pack it (`dotnet pack -c Release`).

## Loading the native library

The bindings load `docs_everywhere` with the platform's normal rules
(`libdocs_everywhere.dylib`, `libdocs_everywhere.so`, or `docs_everywhere.dll` next to the app or on the
library search path). Set `DOCS_EVERYWHERE_LIBRARY` to a full path to load a
specific file instead.

